// Polo dashboard. Build with: scroll build ixtapa-zihuatanejo.polo.scroll
// Camera embeds checked on their Webcams de México source pages on 2026-09-23.
// Map pins are approximate hotel locations.
// NHC advisory 13, 2026-09-23 15:00 CST, EP172026:
// https://www.nhc.noaa.gov/text/MIATCPEP2.shtml
// Tropical storm warning: Tecpan de Galeana to Punta San Telmo, including Ixtapa–Zihuatanejo.

replace STORM_NAME Hurricane Polo
replace REGION_LABEL Ixtapa–Zihuatanejo, Mexico
replace EMERGENCY_LABEL NHC Polo updates ↗
replace EMERGENCY_URL https://www.nhc.noaa.gov/graphics_ep2.shtml?cone#contents
replace MAP_LABEL IXTAPA–ZIHUATANEJO COAST
replace MAP_NOTE Guerrero, mainland Mexico · Pins approximate
replace TV_HEADING Regional coverage
replace PAGE_NOTE Mainland watch: Ixtapa–Zihuatanejo lies within the Tecpan de Galeana–Punta San Telmo tropical-storm warning area in NHC advisory 13 (September 23, 2026, 3 p.m. CST). Coastal wind, flooding rain and dangerous surf are the concern; the forecast keeps Polo’s core offshore. Follow NHC and local authorities for current warnings. Cameras: Webcams de México. Forecast issue times appear on NOAA graphics.
replace WEATHER_PROVIDER NOAA
replace MAP_LATITUDE 17.65
replace MAP_LONGITUDE -101.58
replace MAP_ZOOM 12

